                            <comment id="29949141" author="tdorau" created="Mon, 25 May 2026 23:33:32 +0530"  >&lt;p&gt;The feature satisfies the requirements needed for integration with SceneScape in 2026.2 (as part of the long-term SceneScape + VIPPET + Geti integration effort - see feature &lt;a href=&quot;https://jira.devtools.intel.com/browse/ITEP-87215&quot; class=&quot;external-link&quot; rel=&quot;nofollow&quot;&gt;https://jira.devtools.intel.com/browse/ITEP-87215&lt;/a&gt;). Deleting models is not required for SceneScape.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
                            <comment id="29938663" author="bharagha" created="Sun, 24 May 2026 14:32:58 +0530"  >&lt;p&gt;Committing to the ticket. We will revert over the course of the design and implementation if there is any open that needs discussion.&lt;/p&gt;</comment>
